 \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>     air ent</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ry + coar</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>se </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>crept</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> @ base.</span></p>\n<figure class=\"mm-figure\" data-mm-figure-id=\"a210603c57fc17eb68034a2e\" data-mm-topic-id=\"t-mm-09-014\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Source figure a210603c57fc17eb68034a2e\" viewbox=\"904875 -38100 257175 285750\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" data-mm-object-manifest=\"0210ebb40c38b5b6929b632c33afe379d2e7c81b7ec09f4546ee817a76e36c30\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow-end-67e9c850a8dfaf3ba3ae\" markerwidth=\"10\" markerheight=\"7\" refx=\"9\" refy=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\" markerunits=\"strokeWidth\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10 3.5 L 0 7 Z\" fill=\"#000000\"></path></marker></defs><g data-mm-object-id=\"67e9c850a8dfaf3ba3ae\" transform=\"translate(1033145 9731)\"><g transform=\"translate(0 0) translate(5080 71120) rotate(0) scale(-1 1) translate(-5080 -71120)\"><path d=\"M 0 0 L 10160 142240\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-opacity=\"1\" stroke-width=\"12700\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-end-67e9c850a8dfaf3ba3ae)\"></path></g></g></svg></figure>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17046]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 18pt\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>CXR </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>lobe consolidation/ collapse.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[17047]\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt\">\u00a0</